**Scenario (E-commerce):** Implementing this pattern to handle products efficiently.

Promise.all rejects immediately on first failure (fail-fast), potentially leaving other promises in flight without cleanup. The remaining operations continue running but their results are discarded.

PROBLEM:
```javascript
async function uploadFiles(files) {
  // If file[0] fails, Promise.all rejects
  // Files 1 and 2 continue uploading but results are discarded
  const urls = await Promise.all(files.map(uploadFile));
  return urls;
