**Scenario (E-commerce):** Implementing this pattern to handle products efficiently.

The Cache API stores Request/Response pairs for offline use. Combined with Service Workers to implement caching strategies: cache-first, network-first, stale-while-revalidate.

Cache-first (offline-capable, fast):
```javascript
self.addEventListener('fetch', (event) => {
  event.respondWith(
    caches.match(event.request).then(cached => {
      if (cached) return cached;
      return fetch(event.request).then(res => {
        const clone = res.clone();
        caches.open('v1').then(c => c.put(event.request, clone));
        return res;
      });
