- Navigation away cancels in-flight requests (userSignal) + timeout kills stale ones (timeoutSignal)
- Component unmount signal + global app shutdown signal
- Per-request timeout combined with session-level abort

Note: AbortSignal.any() is Baseline 2024 (March 2024+). For older environments use manual AbortController that listens to each signal.

