Promise.withResolvers() returns { promise, resolve, reject } — exposes resolve/reject outside the executor. Replaces the Deferred pattern with cleaner syntax.

Old Deferred pattern:
```javascript
let resolve, reject;
const promise = new Promise((res, rej) => {
  resolve = res;
  reject = rej;
});
// resolve and reject now accessible externally
```

With withResolvers (cleaner):
```javascript
const { promise, resolve, reject } = Promise.withResolvers();
// Same result — no nesting required
```

Event-to-promise bridge:
```javascript
function waitForEvent(emitter, event, errorEvent) {
  const { promise, resolve, reject } = Promise.withResolvers();
  emitter.once(event, resolve);
  emitter.once(errorEvent || 'error', reject);
  return promise;
}

// Wait for WebSocket to open
const { promise: ready, resolve: onOpen, reject: onError } = Promise.withResolvers();
ws.addEventListener('open', onOpen);
ws.addEventListener('error', onError);
await ready;
```

Async queue implementation:
```javascript
class PromiseQueue {
  #waiters = [];
  #items = [];

  async dequeue() {
    if (this.#items.length) return this.#items.shift();
    const { promise, resolve } = Promise.withResolvers();
    this.#waiters.push(resolve);
    return promise;
  }

  enqueue(item) {
    if (this.#waiters.length) {
      this.#waiters.shift()(item); // resolve waiting consumer
    } else {
      this.#items.push(item);
    }
  }
}

const q = new PromiseQueue();
const consumer = async () => {
  while (true) {
    const item = await q.dequeue();
    processItem(item);
  }
};

q.enqueue('task1');
q.enqueue('task2');
```

Manual stream control:
```javascript
const resolvers = [];
const stream = new ReadableStream({
  pull(controller) {
    const { promise, resolve } = Promise.withResolvers();
    resolvers.push({ resolve, controller });
    return promise;
  }
});
```

Available since March 2024 (Baseline 2024). Polyfill: `Promise.withResolvers ??= () => { let r, j; const p = new Promise((res, rej) => { r = res; j = rej; }); return { promise: p, resolve: r, reject: j }; };`

