Safe wrapper that ensures cleanup:
```javascript
async function* withCleanup(gen) {
  try {
    yield* gen;
  } finally {
    await gen.return(); // ensure inner generator cleaned up
  }
}

// Or use try/finally with for-await:
async function consume(gen) {
  try {
    for await (const item of gen) {
      if (shouldStop(item)) break;
      process(item);
    }
  } finally {
    await gen.return(); // explicit cleanup even on break/error
  }
}
```

